    "why": "The studied driver's staged loader (H005) walks stages in order: stage 1 loads the customer certificate (to device address 0xA0000) and the SCU firmware (0x20000) before stage 2's device-tree blob and stage 3's boot chain (SPL, fitImage, rootfs). The certificate must be in place first; without stage 1 the later stages cannot be trusted or started. The hailo10h/ directory is selected by the device ID read in H003 (1e60:45c4 = Hailo-10H)."
