  "notes": [
    "The staged loader also lists hailo/hailo10h/u-boot-tfa.itb for stage 3, flagged OPTIONAL; it is absent from /lib/firmware/hailo/hailo10h/ on Mimir. All MANDATORY files for all three stages are present.",
    "The set is a full boot chain for the Hailo-10H's on-chip application CPU: SPL -> U-Boot device tree -> fitImage (Yocto Linux 5.15.32) -> root filesystem image.",
    "Per L7, Aesir never ships, embeds, or fetches these blobs; they are a user-side prerequisite. Only hashes and sizes are recorded here \u2014 no firmware bytes enter the repo.",
